{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-04-03 13:45:00', 'title': 'HII LAUNCHES NATIONAL SECURITY CUTTER CALHOUN (WMSL 759)', 'text': "PASCAGOULA, MISS., APRIL 03, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HII (NYSE: HII) LAUNCHED THE LEGEND-CLASS NATIONAL SECURITY CUTTER CALHOUN (WMSL 759) ON SATURDAY AT THE COMPANY'S INGALLS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION. LAUNCHING CALHOUN IS THE FIRST OF A SERIES OF SIGNIFICANT MILESTONE EVENTS IN BRINGING THE SHIP TO LIFE."}